{"strongs": "H3395", "word": "יְרֹחָם", "translit": "ye.ro.cham", "root": "רחם", "morph": "N:N-M-P", "pos": "proper name, masculine", "gloss": "may he be compassionated", "definition": "יְרֹחָם proper name, masculine ( may he be compassionated ; compare Lag BN 134 ); — 1. father of Elkanah, grandfather of Samuel, Ephraimite 1Sam 1:1 ( Ιερεμε[ι]ηλ , A Ιεροαμ ); Levite 1Chr 6:12 ; 1Chr 6:19 ( Ιδαερ , Ηααλ ; A Ιεροβοαμ , Ιερεαμ ; ᵐ5 L Ιεραμαηλ ). 2. Benjamites: \\ \\ a. 1Chr 8:27 Ιρααμ , etc. (apparently = יְרֵמוֺת v 1Chr 8:14 ). \\ \\ b. 1Chr 9:8 , ᵐ5 id. (= a ?). 3. priests: \\ \\ a. 1Chr 9:12 , Ι ( ε ) ρααμ , etc. \\ \\ b. Neh 11:11 , Ι ( ε ) ροαμ . 4. father of a hero of David 1Chr 12:8 ( van d. H. v. 1Chr 12:7 ), Ρααμ , A ᵐ5 L Ιεροαμ . 5. Danite 1Chr 27:22 , Ιωραμ ( ᵐ5 L as 4 ). 6. father of a captain with Jehoiada, 2Chr 23:1 , Ιωραμ .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB7870')\">BDB7870</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H3395')\">H3395</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB7869')\">BDB7869</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB7871')\">BDB7871</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>יְרֹחָם</bdbheb> <b>proper name, masculine</b> (<highlight>may he be compassionated</highlight>; compare <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Lag')\">Lag<sup>BN 134</sup></lookup>); — <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> father of Elkanah, grandfather of Samuel, Ephraimite <ref ref=\"1Sam 1:1\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(9,1,1)\">1Sam 1:1</ref> (<grk>Ιερεμε[ι]ηλ</grk>, <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('A')\"><reflink>A</reflink></lookup> <grk>Ιεροαμ</grk>); Levite <ref ref=\"1Chr 6:12\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(13,6,12)\">1Chr 6:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Chr 6:19\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(13,6,19)\">1Chr 6:19</ref> (<grk>Ιδαερ</grk>, <grk>Ηααλ</grk>; <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('A')\"><reflink>A</reflink></lookup> <grk>Ιεροβοαμ</grk>, <